 1406|  1.57M|  bit_depth: usize, pmv: [MotionVector; 2], lambda: u32, use_satd: bool,
 1407|  1.57M|  mvx_min: isize, mvx_max: isize, mvy_min: isize, mvy_max: isize, w: usize,
